**Methodology.** Flight Plan single-file cockpit per project. Builder/Verifier firewall — *deterministic tests are the primary check on code; substrate separation is defense-in-depth, and primary for decisions with no executable test*. Tier-based verification (T1 foundational/hard-to-reverse → T4 cosmetic). Hold points fire at phase transitions. RTDT ("Read the Damn Thermometer") cuts scope creep. Single-writer rule on wiki articles; flight plans and handoff folders are documented exceptions.

